        // by construction; the #308 comment records the same non-wrap at this seat for the
        // raw-List shape — the receiver seat, unlike the evaluate-arg seat, has NO green
        // bare-collapse form to protect). Golden: `MapperS.of(MapperS.of(businessEvent)
        // .<Instruction>mapC(…).get())\n\t.mapSingleToItem(…)` (Qualify_Repurchase cdm5+cdm6).
