        // type resolves and until v3.2 seat 12 for the rest (`Objects.equals(<Type>, <mapper>) ? … : null`, a
        // COMPILE ERROR: a type literal compared by Objects.equals to a Mapper; a refusal since — TYPE_ per
        // resolvable case, then R1). The receiver is the multi alias the legacy cardinality computer
        // mis-reads as SINGLE, so the method is `mapItem` (alias-multi resolved). Green-safe by
