        // facet lambdaItemReceiverType (v3.1 flip seat 32, law A.2 wrapperItemReceiverBind):
        // bind the compiled RECEIVER's item type for this lambda's implicit item BEFORE the
        // body compiles - the receiver-render typing channel, RE-LANDED from seat 31's
