        LambdaCompiled lambda = compileLambda(expr.body(), ctx, compiler, position);
        // facet extractLadderChainTypeStamp (PR #387): a ladder-block lambda whose typed
        // empty rendered a META element (LambdaCompiled.chainItemType — the arm-join
        // render truth) stamps the chain's type instead of null, so the compiled-type-
        // gated consumers see it (GetUnderlierLEIForCreditCSA: the generic-isAdd
        // coerceAddValueMetaItem A4 arm derefs `.<String>map("Type coercion", …)` before
