            // facet argPosRuleRefWrapThenArg (seat 15, PR #586): the LAW-69 port of
            // FunctionExpressionRenderer's facet ruleRefWrapThenArg (PR #360) to
            // THIS seat — the ARGUMENT-POSITION decl producer. Both seats emit the same
            // `final Mapper*<X> thenArgN = …;` declaration for a then-chain whose k==0 BASE is a
            // bare no-arg RULE reference; when that rule's rosetta OUTPUT is a META wrapper over
