            // AST-gated exactly like the #308 only-element seat (RSymbolReference → RFunction
            // with a multi output); a rule-call value is already MapperC.of-wrapped by
            // renderImplicitRuleInvocation and a nav/list-op value is a Mapper — neither is an
            // RSymbolReference here, byte-unchanged. Green-safe by construction: a raw List
            // into a MapperC local never compiled.
            String declValueStr = HandlerHelper.render(valExpr);
            // facet argPosRuleRefWrapThenArg (seat 15): the decl's RHS becomes the #264
            // null-guard wrap ternary over the hoisted local. Placed here, ahead of the arms
            // below, so the ONE value string every later arm inspects is the final one; each of
            // those arms declines on this shape by its own existing gate (the #333 MapperC arm is
            // `!single`; the #339 bare-invokable wrap requires `unwrapToBuilder().isEmpty()` and
